{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13224250","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322425001:1":{"text":"내 영토에 발을 들였으니 내 지휘를 따라야 해!","source_cn":"你们踏入了我的领地，就要听从我的指挥！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D50042E1E497C9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322425002:1":{"text":"영토?","source_cn":"领地？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x653454D98E502315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322425003:1":{"text":"쉿, 쉿! 치피가 해결할게!","source_cn":"嘘、嘘！看满满的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15A9CA2427A006DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322425004:1":{"text":"크흠... 전하! 전하의 영토를 거쳐 가면서 인사를 드리지 않을 수 없지요. 경배를 받으소서!","source_cn":"咳咳……殿下，我们经由您的领地，怎可不来打声招呼，献上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A0559A38D25822C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322425005:1":{"text":"하! 좋아, 아주 좋아!","source_cn":"哈！说得好！说得好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9C9817EDAF3AA32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322425006:1":{"text":"전하의 영토에 최근 불온한 움직임이 있다 들었습니다. 자칭 위대한 의지라고 하는 자가 백성들에게 영향을 미치고 있다는 소식을 들으셨습니까?","source_cn":"我听说您的领地最近波澜四起，诡谲潜伏，有些自称伟大意志...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15975910E138D20C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322425007:1":{"text":"윽 뭐...? 불... 그게 무슨 뜻이야? 알아듣기 쉽게 말해!","source_cn":"呃，什么……诡……？什么意思？你还是说白话吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD1543C489118B60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322425008:1":{"text":"전하의 영토에 위대한 의지를 퍼뜨리는 사람들이 있었냐는 말이에요.","source_cn":"他问你最近地盘上有没有一些伟大意志的传教士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A2408DCD0874920","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322425009:1":{"text":"있기는 한데, 하지만...","source_cn":"有倒是有，不过呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2E278175CE6425B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322425010:1":{"text":"하지만? 무슨 일인가요? 전하, 어서 말해주세요!","source_cn":"不过什么？殿下尽管说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x973EF3116BAB4A0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322425011:1":{"text":"날 이기면 말해주지! 받아랏!","source_cn":"不过你得打赢我们！看招！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CA18030DB12E7CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1322425012:1":{"text":"아야! 스노우볼이네요, 하하... 우리 마스터도 가만히 있지는 않을 거예요!","source_cn":"哎哟！是雪球！哈哈……我的主人也不是吃素的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4E1E0A7416FD004F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아야! 스노우볼이네요, 하하... 우리 마스터도 가만히 있지는 않을 거예요!","female":"아야! 스노우볼이네요, 하하... 우리 마스터도 가만히 있지는 않을 거예요!","variant_male_record_index":"151407","variant_female_record_index":"151408","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1322425013:1":{"text":"반격! 마스터, 어서 반격해요!","source_cn":"还击！主人我们快还击！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB2BDFBD3691B79F9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"반격! 마스터, 어서 반격해요!","female":"반격! 마스터, 어서 반격해요!","variant_male_record_index":"151409","variant_female_record_index":"151410","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:孩子王格列布":{"text":"아이들의 대장 글레프","source":"孩子王格列布","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":3}}